  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the yakimono-grill to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and bell pepper and cook until they are softened.",
    "Add the vegetarian Croatian sausages and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "In a small bowl, mix the yeast, flour, and yogurt to make a creamy sauce.",
    "Add the creamy sauce to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the preheated yakimono-grill and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Remove the skillet from the grill and serve hot."
